{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 83817, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 58696, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "RB模式攻略", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1627343586, "updated_at": 1634385267, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1634385267, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "10月1日，日服暗塞特正式实装RB模式，简单来说就是RAID活动里单独的一个BOSS本，由于大佬们RDBOSS秒的太快，所以策划搞了个新模式:REGNABURST！直译为爆发模式（简称RB模式），本模", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 9, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 10552, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 2, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 83817, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"\">10月1日，日服暗塞特正式实装RB模式，简单来说就是RAID活动里单独的一个BOSS本，由于大佬们RD BOSS秒的太快<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">，所以策划搞了个新模式:REGNABURST！直译为爆发模式（简称RB模式），本模式可以挑战更强大的BOSS，共20轮BOSS，首层血量4600W，每层增加一千多万，20层2.6亿血。通关每层都有各种奖励，皮肤在3层，20层奖励一个随机3红石头。<br><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">1.RB主界面</span></p></div></span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span><span style=\"\"><br><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633620578566_93574826.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633620578566_93574826.jpg\"></div><br></div><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">2.血量统计</span></span></span></p></div></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">感谢 静静 大佬提供~</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633795177696_66555590.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633795177696_66555590.jpg\"></div></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div><span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">3.战斗模式</p></div><br></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※</span>RB的门票是根据RAID次数补充的，每进行20次RAID，就可以补充1张RB门票，这次RAID白金箱子有几率开到活动物品松果，商店里每天也能换一个，在锻造里2个松果可以合成一张票。门票可以一直保留累计到活动结束，活动结束未用完的门票每张会转化为水晶。<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※</span>每次攻击后的伤害会保留，下次挑战会从上次结束的血量开始。<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span>觉得自己打得不好</span>可以直接退</span>出，票保留，只有打完结算才消耗票。</span></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">4.加成援助</p></div><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><span>※玩家图鉴内的特定天子和特定礼装可以为战斗赋予额外效果（不需<span>要上场），<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">角色练度只吃加值和点火，魂卡只吃加值。</span><span>不需要现在就持有，</span><span>比如说你曾经抽到一个五星角色，然后+3了。之后觉得它没用，就全当素材喂掉了，</span><span>系统也认为你的加成是这个五星角色+3。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div>※加成的具体效果根据你角色的加值和点火值，会分布在L1~L70加成之间。只有五星角色是L1加成，满加满点火是L70加成。<br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※</span>经过初步测试，天子突破加值每+1提高L4加成，最高提供L24加成，点火12个孔，中间孔每个提供约L3.5加成，两边的孔每个提供约L4加成，最高提供L46加成。</div><div><br></div></span><div><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></span></span></span></span></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633504292067_91568322.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633504292067_91568322.png\"></div><br></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div><span><span><span></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div><span><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">5.最终爆裂</p></div><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span>为RB模式的特殊机制，在一场战斗结束后，会额外追加总伤害倍率的伤害，以上图为例最终爆裂加成为14.1+5+1.7+2.7=23.5%，如果你每场输出3000W伤害会追加705万伤害。&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">6.奖励一览</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">跟韩服奖励差不多</span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633621926400_19977700.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633621926400_19977700.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633621931602_56422624.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633621931602_56422624.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633621935696_81853150.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633621935696_81853150.png\"></div><br></span></div></div>\n                               </div></span></span></span></span></div></span></span><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">7.暗赛特RB组队攻略</p></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※</span>BOSS特点：大部分跟RAID BOSS一样，多了禁止吸血（武器吸血不受影响），最重要的一点，RB BOSS吃感电。<br></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※</span>DS设置：1对策 2随意 3鲁邦，队长对策、光兔子都行。</div><div></div></span><div><br></div><div><br></div><div data-col=\"6\" class=\"selectItem mould-table-wrap\" contenteditable=\"false\" model-id=\"69244\" data-insertcount=\"0\" data-select=\"[]\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"table-container\">\n                                  <div class=\"table-overflow\">\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <table class=\"mould-table selectItemTable col-group-table\" style=\"width: 598px;\">\n                                      <colgroup><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 102px;\"><col style=\"width: 106px;\"><col style=\"width: 108px;\"><col style=\"width: 112px;\"><col style=\"width: 108px;\"></colgroup>\n                                      <tbody>\n                                        \n                                      <tr style=\"height: 89px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">阵容1（非巨佬均推荐该阵容</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"><img style=\"object-fit: contain; width: 84px; height: 84px; display: block; margin: auto;\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633010584126_25602857.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633010584126_25602857.png\"></div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"><img style=\"object-fit:contain;width:82px;height:82px;display:block;margin:auto;\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633010634800_63660869.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1633010634800_63660869.png\"></div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"><img style=\"object-fit:contain;width:82px;height:82px;display:block;margin:auto;\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/16330